
# Build output
# Local env / logs
# air live-reload
# local ops
*.exe
*.exe~
# A renamed binary is still a binary. `*.exe` does not match calvoproxy.exe.old
# (what `calvoproxy update` leaves behind) or calvoproxy.exe.bak-pre-v0.7.0,
# which is how 21 MB of stale binary got committed in #32 and had to be removed
# again in #39.
*.exe.*
*.log
*~
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
/calvoproxy
/calvoproxy.exe
/tmp/
build-errors.log
ensure-*.ps1
ensure-*.ps1.bak
ensure-calvoproxy.ps1
proxy.err
proxy.out
start-hidden.vbs
verify.exe
coverage.out
